# Copy to leaderboard_server_pubkey.txt. 64 hex characters = the server's
# long-term X25519 public key. The client pins it, so the v2 handshake fails
# against any other server. Without this file the client falls back to the v1
# pre-shared-key handshake.
#
# The server prints its public key at startup, or generate the identity with
#   leaderboard_server --port 0 --identity <file>
# and take the "server public key" line from its output.
ad36dfe93b3c042afa3ca3b1200590819f89c5bea6ec713a896ca6985d9b3e21
